; DOMAIN: perrin-riou [CLOSED, derived 2026-07-25]
; Claim: The Perrin-Riou big exponential (regulator) map Omega interpolates the Bloch-Kato exponential exp_BK and dual-exponential exp* along the cyclotomic tower. For a crystalline rep V, Omega: (D_cris(V) tensor H(Gamma))-modules -> Iwasawa cohomology H^1_Iw(K_infty,V), inverting exp_BK twist-by-twist: specializing at a character chi of Gamma recovers exp_BK (or exp*) at that finite level, with explicit Coleman-map / Gamma-factor normalization. Coleman power series realize norm-compatible units/classes as measures on Gamma (Iwasawa algebra Lambda), and Perrin-Riou explicit reciprocity computes the cup-product pairing of the Coleman map against exp*, identifying the image of the Euler system under Omega with the p-adic L-function. This is the explicit-reciprocity bridge tying euler_system classes to L_p, completing the analytic side of the Iwasawa Main Conjecture.
; Bridge: genesis_euler_system (Omega sends the norm-compatible Euler-system classes in H^1_Iw to the p-adic L-function via explicit reciprocity, converting the Selmer upper bound into the L_p divisibility) + genesis_bloch_kato (Omega is the Lambda-adic interpolation of the Bloch-Kato exponential exp_BK: D_dR/Fil^0 -> H^1_f, twist-by-twist recovering crystalline Selmer classes) + genesis_iwasawa (the image of Omega is the p-adic L-function generating char_Lambda, matching the Main Conjecture char_Lambda(Sel)=(L_p)).
(= (big-exp-map $V) (interpolate (bloch-kato-exp $V) (cyclotomic-tower)))
(= (coleman-map $u) (measure (gamma) (norm-compatible $u)))
(= (explicit-reciprocity $x) (equal (pairing (coleman-map $x) (dual-exp)) (p-adic-l-function $x)))
(= (specialize-omega $chi) (bloch-kato-exp (twist $chi)))
(= (omega-image (euler-system $V)) (p-adic-l-function $V))